---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: chbench_q20"
---
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |  Sort: supplier.su_name ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |   Projection: supplier.su_name, supplier.su_address                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: supplier.su_nationkey = nation.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       Filter: supplier.su_suppkey IN (<subquery>)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |         Subquery:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |           Projection: mod(stock.s_i_id * stock.s_w_id, Int64(10000))                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |             Filter: Int64(2) * stock.s_quantity > sum(order_line.ol_quantity)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |               Aggregate: groupBy=[[stock.s_i_id, stock.s_w_id, stock.s_quantity, stock.s_dist_01, stock.s_dist_02, stock.s_dist_03, stock.s_dist_04, stock.s_dist_05, stock.s_dist_06, stock.s_dist_07, stock.s_dist_08, stock.s_dist_09, stock.s_dist_10, stock.s_ytd, stock.s_order_cnt, stock.s_remote_cnt, stock.s_data, stock._bench_ts]], aggr=[[sum(order_line.ol_quantity)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_i_id = stock.s_i_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                   Inner Join:  Filter: item.i_id = stock.s_i_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                     TableScan: stock                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                     TableScan: item, full_filters=[item.i_data LIKE Utf8("co%")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                   TableScan: order_line, full_filters=[order_line.ol_delivery_d > Utf8("2010-05-23 12:00:00")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |         TableScan: supplier projection=[su_suppkey, su_name, su_address, su_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |       TableScan: nation projection=[n_nationkey], full_filters=[nation.n_name = Utf8("CHINA")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=//data/accelerated_duckdb.db base_sql=SELECT "supplier"."su_name", "supplier"."su_address" FROM "supplier" INNER JOIN "nation" ON (("supplier"."su_nationkey" = "nation"."n_nationkey") AND ("supplier"."su_suppkey" IN (SELECT mod(("stock"."s_i_id" * "stock"."s_w_id"), 10000) FROM "stock" INNER JOIN "item" ON (("item"."i_id" = "stock"."s_i_id") AND "item"."i_data" LIKE 'co%') INNER JOIN "order_line" ON (("order_line"."ol_i_id" = "stock"."s_i_id") AND ("order_line"."ol_delivery_d" > '2010-05-23 12:00:00')) GROUP BY "stock"."s_i_id", "stock"."s_w_id", "stock"."s_quantity", "stock"."s_dist_01", "stock"."s_dist_02", "stock"."s_dist_03", "stock"."s_dist_04", "stock"."s_dist_05", "stock"."s_dist_06", "stock"."s_dist_07", "stock"."s_dist_08", "stock"."s_dist_09", "stock"."s_dist_10", "stock"."s_ytd", "stock"."s_order_cnt", "stock"."s_remote_cnt", "stock"."s_data", "stock"."_bench_ts" HAVING ((2 * "stock"."s_quantity") > sum("order_line"."ol_quantity"))) AND ("nation"."n_name" = 'CHINA'))) ORDER BY "supplier"."su_name" ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
